"107","0107","TRC-23-HW2-B-0107","2026-08-23T21:45:00Z","23","HW2-B","build","105","HW2 C-AUD (disclosure is the member-facing dimension of the audit spine); HW-SEC tenant scope","spine","I23-HW2B-disclosures","hardening/compliance-breadth","[framework v1.5] HW2 breadth: HIPAA accounting-of-disclosures (AUD-10) - record who received a member's PHI, when, purpose; classify accountable vs exempt (treatment/payment/operations); enforce 6-year retention (flag purgeable, never auto-delete). Wired: FHIR break-glass records an accountable disclosure; /api/ops/disclosures returns the accounting.","audit.md AUD-10 (accounting-of-disclosures, read-audit, retention); the C-AUD tamper-evident ledger; the FHIR break-glass path","src/lib/server/disclosure.ts (DisclosureLog + isAccountable + retention + fail-closed factory) + FHIR break-glass disclosure recording + src/app/api/ops/disclosures/route.ts (tenant+authz) + tests. Gates: tsc 0, disclosure+fhir tests pass, E14 122/122 (entries 232->233, reachable 581->583 WIRED), demo 26 pass.","green","","live","AUD-10 accounting-of-disclosures with HIPAA accountable/exempt classification + 6-year retention. PHI-safe (references+purpose only). Break-glass over a consent opt-out is correctly recorded as accountable. Demo untouched."
